      "239013172"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8681607246398926
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 4,
    "unit_id": "S57339175cf3c8935ef1c",
    "text": "游戏的玩法与关卡设计确实精彩，总能在熟悉一种机制之后，又带来新的机制和玩法",
    "review_ids": [
      "238703391"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8669536709785461
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 5,
    "unit_id": "S6ff4f7c97ff975c50c33",
    "text": "可玩性挺高，游戏画面和音乐都不错",
    "review_ids": [
      "237606556"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "audiovisual"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8650939464569092
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 6,
    "unit_id": "S149337e7f2e7303eeb98",
    "text": "好玩,游戏体验非常充实,新世代玩家多花点时间也能上手,唯一缺点就是一玩天色就变",
    "review_ids": [
      "236141939"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "controls_difficulty"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.863569438457489
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 7,
    "unit_id": "S702f4892618634d0aa06",
    "text": "我觉得特别好玩，尤其是你玩多了之后会连招的成就感，真心爱玩",
    "review_ids": [
      "238754814"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "content_support"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8602334856987
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 8,
    "unit_id": "Safcc0c72dea9f357c489",
    "text": "太好玩了，比现在某些“3A”游戏的互动反馈还有物理引擎好多了，还有超级清晰的指引以及有趣的玩法，剧情也是很好的",
    "review_ids": [
      "237119034"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8598883152008057
  },
  {
    "cluster": 4,
    "rank": 1,
    "unit_id": "Sf7b3497d8457793dbde7",
    "text": "It adds another layer of complexity, forces you to think more tactically, make better use of every character's abilities, and really get the most out of your party",
    "review_ids": [
      "239007456"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8148283362388611
  },
  {
    "cluster": 4,
    "rank": 2,
    "unit_id": "Sb42503c567c1948611df",
    "text": "Lot of skill and build options too",
    "review_ids": [
      "237730350"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8064404726028442
  },
  {
    "cluster": 4,
    "rank": 3,
    "unit_id": "S0c569b921f7e91bbb5b0",
    "text": "The play at your own pace, while you explore, catch, build, craft, grind, and level up gives you tons of options.",
